Based on the Chrome DevTools flow (calling Target.setDiscoverTargets, listening for Target.targetCreated, attaching to each iframe target and then enabling Network on that session), Lighthouse’s driver needs to do the exact same thing when driving a page load. In `lighthouse-core/gather/driver.js` inside `Driver.gotoURL()`, after we turn on the Page domain we should also turn on target discovery, hook into new iframe targets, attach to them, and enable the Network domain on each of those child sessions.

